+          <span class="eyebrow">Privacy engineering</span>
+          <h1>NullTrace.</h1>
+          <p class="lead">NullTrace is a client-side Fabric mod that reduces the information Minecraft servers can use to identify, fingerprint, or track a modded client. It started from OpSec's client-side privacy work and now runs its own codebase, branding, and version support for Minecraft 26.2 and 26.3.</p>
+          <div class="action-row">
+            <a class="button button-blue" href="https://github.com/International-Duck-Incorporated/NullTrace" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><svg><use href="#i-github"/></svg>View repository</a>
